The init sequence is: platform_prepare, state_create, worker_start,
proc_publish, scheduler_start. Each step that can fail needs a goto
label that undoes it and everything before it in reverse order.

The exit sequence is the reverse: proc_unpublish, scheduler_stop,
worker_stop, transaction_restore, transaction_dispose, state_destroy,
platform_finish. The transaction restore must happen after the worker
stops (so no concurrent apply) and before platform_finish (so the
filesystem is still reachable).
